Scope / Escopo

This MIT License covers the code in this repository: scripts/, app/ (except
app/fonts/), and .github/. The text and catalog content (Markdown files,
api/, llms.txt, publicacao.json) is under CC BY 4.0, see LICENSE-CONTENT.md.
The fonts in app/fonts/ keep their own SIL OFL 1.1 license, see
app/fonts/OFL.txt and app/fonts/LICENSES.md. Third-party works that are only
cited as inspiration are not redistributed and are not covered by this
repository's licenses.

Esta licença MIT cobre o código deste repositório: scripts/, app/ (exceto
app/fonts/) e .github/. Os textos e o conteúdo do catálogo (arquivos Markdown,
api/, llms.txt, publicacao.json) estão sob CC BY 4.0, veja LICENSE-CONTENT.md.
As fontes em app/fonts/ mantêm a licença própria SIL OFL 1.1. Obras de
terceiros apenas citadas como inspiração não são redistribuídas e não são
